{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salmon Man is A hardcore VR platformer that will push your skills, patience, and sanity to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Salmon Man, there are no shortcuts, no cheat codes, no easy way out... Or maybe there are? Who knows? I do, but I won't tell you. Try to find out for yourself if you want to waste some time, or not, or maybe you should? Or not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f<strong>Armed with a Paddle</strong><br>Climb upstream with nothing but your paddle to explore a world full of wonder, beauty, and absurdity\u2026 but don\u2019t expect it to go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/5c51fc0b4e93805067833b20f58e30a5.poster.avif?t=1764163909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/5c51fc0b4e93805067833b20f58e30a5.webm?t=1764163909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80<strong>No Shortcuts. No Mercy.</strong><br>One slip can send you crashing all the way back down, forcing you to try, fail, cry, and try again. Every swing of your paddle is both your lifeline and your greatest risk. Master it, and you\u2019ll conquer the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/372e11ac16e838c4f83641cf3d33213c.poster.avif?t=1764163909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/372e11ac16e838c4f83641cf3d33213c.webm?t=1764163909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>A True Test of Will</strong> <br>Whether you play for the climb, the challenge, or the speedrun glory, Salmon Man isn\u2019t just a game, it\u2019s a test of will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/d27070b12f9a94647dc58c71908a9406.poster.avif?t=1764163909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/d27070b12f9a94647dc58c71908a9406.webm?t=1764163909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2654710?t=1764163909","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/a7f81cf48228fef3b00f784bbf48a3c107b8d9bb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764163909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/cc6be59d063b6f26c2f4ef3bde02360fa149ba50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764163909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/cc6be59d063b6f26c2f4ef3bde02360fa149ba50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764163909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4091240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salmon Man is A hardcore VR platformer that will push your skills, patience, and sanity to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Salmon Man, there are no shortcuts, no cheat codes, no easy way out... Or maybe there are? Who knows? I do, but I won't tell you. Try to find out for yourself if you want to waste some time, or not, or maybe you should? Or not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f<strong>Armed with a Paddle</strong><br>Climb upstream with nothing but your paddle to explore a world full of wonder, beauty, and absurdity\u2026 but don\u2019t expect it to go easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/5c51fc0b4e93805067833b20f58e30a5.poster.avif?t=1764163909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/5c51fc0b4e93805067833b20f58e30a5.webm?t=1764163909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80<strong>No Shortcuts. No Mercy.</strong><br>One slip can send you crashing all the way back down, forcing you to try, fail, cry, and try again. Every swing of your paddle is both your lifeline and your greatest risk. Master it, and you\u2019ll conquer the river.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/372e11ac16e838c4f83641cf3d33213c.poster.avif?t=1764163909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2654710/extras/372e11ac16e838c4f83641cf3d33213c.webm?t=1764163909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>A True Test of Will</strong> <br>Whether you play for t